Responsible (R): Coordinator / System
Accountable (A): Contingent Workforce Mgr
Duration: Daily/weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3220_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3220_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
