    <bpmn:process id="W_W3221" name="W3221. Invoice Validation, Timesheet Reconciliation &amp; Approval" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Agency invoice (typically monthly, some weekly)
Frequency: Monthly (some weekly)
Volume: ~30–60 agencies × monthly invoices
Owner: Contingent Workforce Coordinator
Participants: Coordinator, User Dept, Finance/AP (links to VS-15), Procurement (links to VS-34)
Source: workflow W3221 — Invoice Validation, Timesheet Reconciliation &amp; Approval</bpmn:documentation>
