    <bpmn:process id="W_W3222" name="W3222. Asset, Tool &amp; Uniform Issuance &amp; Recovery" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Worker assignment (issue); worker exit (recovery)
Frequency: Per worker assignment
Volume: Hundreds–thousands of issue/recovery cycles/year
Owner: Contingent Workforce Coordinator
Participants: Coordinator, User Dept, Facilities/Stores (links to VS-07/VS-20.3), Asset Mgmt (links to VS-35), Agency
Source: workflow W3222 — Asset, Tool &amp; Uniform Issuance &amp; Recovery</bpmn:documentation>
