    <bpmn:process id="W_W3223" name="W3223. Background Check, NBI &amp; Pre-Engagement Screening" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Worker assignment (before site entry)
Frequency: Per worker assignment
Volume: All contractor workers (security, cash-handling, child-adjacent roles critical)
Owner: Contingent Workforce Coordinator
Participants: Coordinator, Agency, Legal/Compliance, Security (links to VS-23)
Source: workflow W3223 — Background Check, NBI &amp; Pre-Engagement Screening</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3223_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3223_Lane1" name="Agency">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3223_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3223_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3223_Lane2" name="Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3223_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3223_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3223_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3223_Start4" name="Worker assignment (before site entry)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3223_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3223_Task5" name="Agency conducts and certifies pre-engagement screening per category: NBI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Agency conducts and certifies pre-engagement screening per category: NBI clearance (or barangay clearance per W555 provincial context), police clearance, prior-employment/reference checks, drug test where lawful/relevant, court records for cash-handling/security roles; provide certification to BuildRight
Responsible (R): Agency / Coordinator
Accountable (A): Contingent Workforce Mgr
Duration: Per worker</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3223_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3223_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3223_Task6" name="Coordinator/Security verify authenticity (NBI certificate verification, agency…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Coordinator/Security verify authenticity (NBI certificate verification, agency credentials); for high-risk roles (security, CIT links to VS-81, cash-handling, IT admin), require enhanced screening and BuildRight Security review; reject where disqualifying findings
Responsible (R): Coordinator / Security
Accountable (A): Contingent Workforce Mgr
Duration: Per worker</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3223_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3223_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3223_Task7" name="Record screening in worker record (links to VS-29/VS-91 privacy controls)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Record screening in worker record (links to VS-29/VS-91 privacy controls); periodic re-screening for long-tenured contractor workers; manage adverse-action due process (DOLE/NLRC) where screening grounds removal
Responsible (R): Coordinator / Legal
Accountable (A): Contingent Workforce Mgr
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3223_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3223_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3223_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3223_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3223_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-524 (ensure controlled execution — Contingent Worker Onboarding, Access &amp; Time Operations (PA-98.2).) | - operational: mandatory screening and re-screening; operational: documented process and legal review
Owner: Contingent Workforce Coordinator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
