    <bpmn:process id="W_W3224" name="W3224. Daily Contractor Supervision &amp; Performance Monitoring" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily operations
Frequency: Daily
Volume: All active contractor crews across 200 stores + 4 DCs + HQ
Owner: User Department Head
Participants: User Dept (Store Mgr/DC Mgr/HQ Mgr), Contractor Supervisor, Coordinator, Safety
Source: workflow W3224 — Daily Contractor Supervision &amp; Performance Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3224_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3224_Lane1" name="User Dept">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3224_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3224_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3224_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3224_Lane2" name="Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3224_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3224_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3224_Start4" name="Daily operations">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3224_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3224_Task5" name="User Dept supervises to the SOW (not as employer — W3211 four-fold test)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: User Dept supervises to the SOW (not as employer — W3211 four-fold test): confirm coverage, conduct quality check (cleaning standard, security post, promodizer activity), document exceptions; coordinate through contractor supervisor for corrective action (not direct worker discipline)
Responsible (R): User Dept / Contractor Supervisor
Accountable (A): User Dept Head
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3224_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3224_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3224_Task6" name="User Dept/Safety monitor HSE compliance and conduct (PPE, conduct toward…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: User Dept/Safety monitor HSE compliance and conduct (PPE, conduct toward customers/staff, no prohibited activities); apply stop-work for safety issues (W3219); escalate conduct/performance issues to contractor supervisor and coordinator
Responsible (R): User Dept / Safety
Accountable (A): User Dept Head
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3224_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3224_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3224_Task7" name="Coordinator aggregates daily observations into periodic performance review…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coordinator aggregates daily observations into periodic performance review (W3225) and incident feed (W3228); route systemic issues to contract management (W3216)
Responsible (R): Coordinator
Accountable (A): Contingent Workforce Mgr
Duration: Daily/weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3224_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3224_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3224_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3224_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3224_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-524 (ensure controlled execution — Contingent Worker Onboarding, Access &amp; Time Operations (PA-98.2).) | - operational: supervisor training (W3211) and contractor-supervisor channel; operational: daily checks and scorecard (W3225)
Owner: User Department Head</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
